#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:3
#: a0d39d931bb74a0490bb796012730232
msgid "随机原子堆积（Random Packing）"
msgstr "Random Packing"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:5
#: f792515af3fe434ab2f02f4722d255cb
msgid "**分类：** 结构"
msgstr "**Category:** Structure"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:7
#: 9432b8eda7b54666a78b65b4602421bc
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:9
#: b21b1a12429b46f597bd75db459a7295
msgid ""
"当训练集只有有序晶体、缺少无序初态时，这张卡以每个输入结构的晶胞为盒子，重新随机放置全部原子。它保留输入的 `cell`、`pbc` 和结构级 "
"`info`；元素计数来自输入组成或手动整数计数。"
msgstr ""
"When a training set contains only ordered crystals and lacks disordered starting "
"configurations, this card uses each input cell as a box and randomly relocates all "
"atoms. It preserves the input `cell`, `pbc`, and structure-level `info`; element "
"counts come from the input composition or manually entered integer counts."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:11
#: aadf14883bfd4ed1a3eb4d1ad052d337
msgid ""
"原位点已经不存在，因此 `spin`、`group`、`initial_magmoms` "
"等逐原子数组不会复制到输出。生成后应检查最短距离分布，再进入弛豫、分子动力学或单点计算流程。"
msgstr ""
"Because the original sites no longer exist, per-atom arrays such as `spin`, `group`, "
"and `initial_magmoms` are not copied to the output. Inspect the minimum-distance "
"distribution before sending generated structures to relaxation, molecular dynamics, "
"or single-point calculations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:13
#: 60bd63242daf40428fb320117b0c323a
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:15
#: 538afe7f91b541b6bee366743efa2809
msgid "每个候选位置先在晶胞的分数坐标中均匀采样："
msgstr "Each candidate position is first sampled uniformly in fractional cell coordinates:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:17
#: 4f505841179e4fb3b637510f5812a22e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{s}\\sim U([0,1)^3),\\qquad\n"
"\\mathbf{r}=\\mathbf{s}^{\\mathsf T}\\mathbf{C},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{s}\\sim U([0,1)^3),\\qquad\n"
"\\mathbf{r}=\\mathbf{s}^{\\mathsf T}\\mathbf{C},\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:22
#: d6c72aeb5a53423a8d51b5328bb32b61
msgid "其中 $\\mathbf C$ 是输入的完整 $3\\times3$ 晶胞矩阵。距离检查使用输入 `pbc` 对应的最小镜像距离，因此支持非正交晶胞和混合周期边界。"
msgstr ""
"Here $\\mathbf C$ is the full $3\\times3$ input cell matrix. Distance checks use "
"minimum-image distances according to the input `pbc`, so non-orthogonal cells and "
"mixed periodic boundaries are supported."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:24
#: 3271469d809d44a3b1ae273119015e13
msgid "新原子 $i$ 只有满足"
msgstr "A new atom $i$ is accepted only if"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:26
#: c79f5ad71ba740ff8b28d11bb2345e99
msgid ""
"\n"
"d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}}\\ge d_{\\min}(Z_i,Z_j),\\qquad \\forall j<i\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:30
#: 94e7da992c4b4f8e8a04334d0f118984
msgid "才被接受。元素对规则优先于全局阈值；没有专用规则的原子对使用全局最小距离。程序先尝试约束较大的元素，以减少后期无位置可放的概率。"
msgstr ""
"Element-pair rules take precedence over the global threshold; pairs without a "
"dedicated rule use the global minimum distance. Elements with larger distance "
"constraints are placed first to reduce the chance of running out of valid positions "
"later."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:32
#: ff33ecb25bb94520b1a53e0f449c7232
msgid "若每个输出含 $N$ 个原子、每个输入请求 $M$ 个输出，则每个输入的生成预算为"
msgstr ""
"If each output contains $N$ atoms and $M$ outputs are requested per input, the "
"generation budget per input is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:34
#: cb17ff9a3ab948e0afc244f552dddfa8
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{generated}}=N\\times M.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:38
#: 9c59747708254883a47c2b4dd2e8eb87
msgid "它不得超过“生成原子预算/输入”。严格模式成功时输出数精确为 $M$；关闭严格模式后，失败样本会跳过，输出数最多为 $M$。若全部失败，卡片仍会明确报错。"
msgstr ""
"This value must not exceed `Generated-atom budget per input`. A successful strict-"
"mode run produces exactly $M$ outputs. With strict mode disabled, failed samples are "
"skipped and the output count is at most $M$. If every sample fails, the card still "
"reports an explicit error."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:40
#: 91c11f194c87420099b232a29bb3335b
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:42
#: 6a0483bef0784863b45f3abe109941f3
msgid "输出与组成"
msgstr "Outputs and Composition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:44
#: ecff83a2b6324e13b99f7ded6c82db6a
msgid "每个输入的输出数（structures）"
msgstr "Outputs per Input (structures)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:46
#: f09541a7a20648a4b195a545726c46a7
msgid "`int`，默认 `1`。严格模式下是精确数量；非严格模式下是最大数量。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `1`. An exact count in strict mode and a maximum count in non-strict "
"mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:48
#: 65c71b091ac1463788c76ff538074fdb
msgid "组成（composition）"
msgstr "composition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:50
#: b1884016f25548edabbb019af73bef89
msgid "`str`，默认空。手动模式下填写整数计数，例如 `Fe:32,O:64`。比例值不接受。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default. In manual mode, enter integer counts such as `Fe:32,O:64`. "
"Ratios are not accepted."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:52
#: 8fcc904794bb4f18a1eb7bb6a6bda559
msgid "组成模式（composition_mode）"
msgstr "Composition Mode (composition_mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:54
#: ac2c43f9ac6d481ea5cdafbc2063df2d
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `input`。`input` 沿用输入的元素种类和计数；`manual` 使用 `composition` 中的整数计数，空表会明确报错。旧 JSON"
" 没有此字段时，非空 `composition` 自动按 `manual` 恢复。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `input`. `input` preserves the element species and counts of the "
"input; `manual` uses integer counts from `composition` and rejects an empty table "
"explicitly. When this field is absent from legacy JSON, a nonempty `composition` is "
"restored as `manual` automatically."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:56
#: 8e4e6b01ba4748d9accb297e88e2b1f0
msgid "生成原子预算/输入（max_generated_atoms）"
msgstr "Generated-Atom Budget per Input (max_generated_atoms)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:58
#: f7b83f0b56b347f082fc83f04a46f404
msgid "`int`，默认 `10000`。限制 `structures × 每个输出原子数`，在随机采样和内存分配前检查。需要扩大规模时可以主动提高。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `10000`. Limits `structures × atoms per output` and is checked before "
"random sampling or memory allocation. Increase it explicitly when a larger generation"
" job is intended."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:60
#: b299fc8b9a5548a881641caa7bb4c3e5
msgid "距离与失败合同"
msgstr "Distance and Failure Contract"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:62
#: 1ade061ec2374e4883fd324a24c57580
msgid "全局最小距离（min_distance）"
msgstr "Global Minimum Distance (min_distance)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:64
#: b9d1e283f664404ba3ef26dd2141bf0a
msgid "`float`，默认 `1.5 Å`。所有未单独指定的元素对都使用此下限。它只是初始约束，应根据体系中合理短键选择，而不是通用键长。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `1.5 Å`. This lower bound applies to every element pair without a "
"dedicated override. It is an initial-structure constraint rather than a universal "
"bond length and should be chosen from physically reasonable short distances for the "
"system."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:66
#: 682918f5e75847f0a3ada3a74fdd8c40
msgid "分元素对最小距离（pair_min_distances）"
msgstr "pair_min_distances"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:68
#: e46ccdaf8eb341448ff5708c9fcac549
msgid "`str`，默认空。高级表格中的规则覆盖对应元素对的全局阈值，例如 `Fe-O:1.8,O-O:1.2`。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default. Rules in the advanced table override the global threshold "
"for the corresponding element pairs, for example `Fe-O:1.8,O-O:1.2`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:70
#: 8e4e6b01ba4748d9accb297e88e2b1f0
msgid "每原子最大尝试次数（max_attempts_per_atom）"
msgstr "Maximum Attempts per Atom (max_attempts_per_atom)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:72
#: 7da5dbdf72d44a659a0c13636f21ca21
msgid "`int`，默认 `500`。单个原子达到此尝试次数仍没有合法位置时，该输出失败。持续失败通常意味着晶胞、原子数和距离约束不相容；单纯增大次数只会增加搜索时间。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `500`. An output fails when no valid position is found for one atom "
"within this number of attempts. Repeated failure usually means the cell, atom count, "
"and distance constraints are incompatible; merely increasing the attempt count only "
"increases search time."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:74
#: 8fcc904794bb4f18a1eb7bb6a6bda559
msgid "严格模式（strict_mode）"
msgstr "strict_mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:76
#: 7fd6094479814f3aa4196f82257d95a5
msgid "`bool`，默认 `true`。开启时任一请求样本失败就停止并报错；关闭后跳过失败样本，因此实际输出可能少于请求值。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`. When enabled, failure of any requested sample stops the "
"operation and reports an error. When disabled, failed samples are skipped, so the "
"actual output count can be smaller than requested."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:78
#: 0013c9feeace4455b831ec4e2df0b16f
msgid "随机性"
msgstr "Randomness"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:80
#: cd26319b140c411486c3fc75b36cd6b5
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:82
#: 239b3e6b42394f9b9f14a42d7d6679ce
msgid "`bool`，默认 `false`。开启后，相同输入、参数和 seed 产生相同坐标。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. When enabled, identical inputs, parameters, and seed produce"
" identical coordinates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:84
#: 8dbfc37ea192432eb6f9a705ce049989
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:86
#: eca7a9f3395f46c9bf1bd7e1c1fbd82c
msgid "`int`，默认 `0`，仅在 `use_seed=true` 时生效。实际样本 seed 还结合输入结构稳定标识和样本序号；完全相同的重复输入会得到相同结果。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`, used only when `use_seed=true`. The actual sample seed also "
"incorporates a stable input-structure identifier and the sample index; identical "
"repeated inputs therefore produce identical results."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:88
#: 0fff41827e8045ad8766c601ca4145ee
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:90
#: 108d749d00c646c2ba7fee34e15d84d4
msgid "输入为含 96 个原子的 Fe–O 晶胞，希望生成 20 个可复现的无序初态："
msgstr ""
"For a 96-atom Fe–O input cell, generate 20 reproducible disordered starting "
"configurations:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:92
#: 03d9da791d13470ba28c55ffb34ad9d2
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomPackingCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"structures\": 20,\n"
"    \"composition\": \"\",\n"
"    \"composition_mode\": \"input\",\n"
"    \"min_distance\": 1.5,\n"
"    \"pair_min_distances\": \"Fe-O:1.8,O-O:1.2\",\n"
"    \"max_attempts_per_atom\": 500,\n"
"    \"strict_mode\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42,\n"
"    \"max_generated_atoms\": 10000\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:110
#: 71337c35df214dc6b68dd8fb1672e77d
msgid ""
"预览应显示每个输出 `96` 个原子、每个输入生成 `96×20=1920` 个原子。输出的 `cell` 和 `pbc` "
"与输入一致，所有原子对满足各自阈值，`Config_type` 追加 `RandPack(...)`。"
msgstr ""
"The preview should show `96` atoms per output and `96×20=1920` generated atoms per "
"input. Output `cell` and `pbc` match the input, every atom pair satisfies its "
"applicable threshold, and `RandPack(...)` is appended to `Config_type`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:112
#: 34bba33818314902b7d1020f3ec6c4b6
msgid "检查结果"
msgstr "Checking the Results"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:114
#: c6c422f89d7047cb921eae34a9eb20e4
msgid "查看最短原子对距离是否符合全局和元素对阈值。"
msgstr ""
"Check whether the shortest interatomic distances satisfy the global and element-pair "
"thresholds."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:115
#: a2843e6f480c4d808205d65fec294389
msgid "确认输出组成、晶胞、PBC 和请求数量。"
msgstr "Confirm the output composition, cell, PBC, and requested count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:116
#: 99ddda030bcc4d0e844a940d2fb17792
msgid "对无序初态做后续计算时，检查弛豫或动力学是否出现异常重叠和数值崩溃。"
msgstr ""
"During downstream calculations on disordered starting configurations, check "
"relaxation or dynamics for abnormal overlaps and numerical failures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:118
#: e874a60567644fa494aac675a1e63286
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:120
#: c9150506b924435e85c0ae9a07e4dab5
msgid "**为什么手动组成必须写整数？** 随机装填需要先建立确定的原子列表；比例到整数的换算应在上游确定晶胞规模后完成。"
msgstr ""
"**Why must a manual composition use integers?** Random packing requires a definite "
"atom list before placement. Convert ratios to integer counts upstream after choosing "
"the cell size."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:122
#: 287c5e0e6afe48d3bfa6acf8c0011931
msgid "**为什么提高尝试次数仍可能失败？** 尝试次数只扩大随机搜索，不会增加晶胞可容纳的空间。持续失败时应优先检查原子数、晶胞体积和距离阈值。"
msgstr ""
"**Why can packing still fail after increasing the attempt count?** More attempts only"
" extend the random search; they do not increase the available space in the cell. For "
"repeated failures, inspect the atom count, cell volume, and distance thresholds "
"first."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "参数设置：`structures=20`，`composition=\"\"`，`min_distance=1.5`，`pair_min_distances=\"Fe-O:1.8,O-O:1.2\"`，`strict_mode=True`，打开"
#~ " `use_seed`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Set `structures=20`, `composition=\"\"`, `min_distance=1.5`, "
#~ "`pair_min_distances=\"Fe-O:1.8,O-O:1.2\"`, and `strict_mode=True`, "
#~ "then enable `use_seed`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "元素半径差异大时你会想用这个——O-O 通常比 Fe-O 可以更近一些，同时 Fe-O 可能需要比全局"
#~ " `min_distance` 更宽松。写在 pair 里的距离覆盖全局值，没写的元素对仍然用 "
#~ "`min_distance`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Use pair overrides when species have "
#~ "substantially different sizes or contact "
#~ "requirements. A listed pair replaces the "
#~ "global constraint; unlisted pairs continue to "
#~ "use `min_distance`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "增大它只增加搜索时间，不改变物理可行性。如果你发现它一直失败（几乎每次都触达 500 次上限），不是该调大它——是你的 "
#~ "`min_distance` 设大了，或者 cell 相对原子数太小。先调松距离或扩胞。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Increasing this limit only spends more search"
#~ " time; it cannot make an infeasible packing"
#~ " physically possible. If most placements exhaust"
#~ " all 500 attempts, reduce `min_distance` or "
#~ "use a larger cell before increasing the "
#~ "attempt count."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`bool`，默认 true。打开：只要有一个原子放不下，整个样本就报错，保证输出数量 = "
#~ "设定值。关闭：放不下的样本被跳过，最终输出可能比你设的 `structures` 少。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default: `true`. When enabled, failure "
#~ "to place any atom raises an error for"
#~ " the sample, enforcing the requested output-"
#~ "count contract. When disabled, failed samples "
#~ "are skipped and the output count may be"
#~ " lower than `structures`."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 0。仅 `use_seed` 打开时生效。"
#~ msgstr "`int`, default: `0`. Used only when `use_seed` is enabled."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "开启 `use_seed` 后，随机 packing 由 `seed`、输入结构稳定 ID"
#~ " 和 sample 序号共同决定。相同输入、相同参数、相同 seed 会生成相同坐标。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "With `use_seed` enabled, the packing is "
#~ "determined jointly by `seed`, the input "
#~ "structure's stable ID, and the sample index."
#~ " The same input, parameters, and seed "
#~ "reproduce the same coordinates."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Random Packing` 是原子坐标卡，不是磁性卡。它保留输入结构的 `cell` 和 "
#~ "`pbc`，按输入组成或手动精确组成在 cell 内重新随机放置原子，并用全局和 pair-specific "
#~ "最小距离约束挡掉明显不可能的短键初态。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Random Packing` operates on atomic coordinates, "
#~ "not magnetic moments. It preserves the input"
#~ " `cell` and `pbc`, then redistributes atoms "
#~ "inside the cell using either the input "
#~ "composition or an explicitly specified integer "
#~ "composition. Global and pair-specific minimum "
#~ "distances reject clearly impossible short-contact"
#~ " starting states."

#~ msgid "这张卡解决的是“训练集缺少无序初始构型”，不是“缺少磁矩无序”。磁矩无序使用 `Spin Disorder` 或 `Correlated Random Spin`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Use this card when the training set "
#~ "lacks structurally disordered starting configurations. "
#~ "For disordered magnetic moments, use `Spin "
#~ "Disorder` or `Correlated Random Spin` instead."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\n"
#~ "d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}}\\ge d_{\\min}(Z_i,Z_j)\n"
#~ "\\qquad \\forall j<i\n"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "才接受该位置。元素对专用阈值优先于全局最小距离；所有距离单位为 Å。程序优先放置约束更大 "
#~ "的元素，以降低后期无位置可放的概率，但它仍是带拒绝的随机顺序算法，不保证在高密度条件下 "
#~ "一定找到解。达到每原子最大尝试次数后，严格模式报错，非严格模式跳过该输出样本。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "场景：模型只见过有序晶格，遇到无序初态能量排序不稳定"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Scenario: a model trained only on ordered "
#~ "lattices gives unstable energy rankings for "
#~ "disordered starting states"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "输入是一个已有 cell 和组成的候选结构。你希望在相同 cell 和元素计数下生成 20 "
#~ "个随机原子 packing，用于 amorphous seed、液相初态或高温无序初态的 DFT 采样。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The input is a candidate structure with "
#~ "a defined cell and composition. You want "
#~ "20 random packings with the same cell "
#~ "and element counts for use as amorphous "
#~ "seeds, liquid starting states, or high-"
#~ "temperature disordered configurations for DFT "
#~ "sampling."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "参数设置：`structures=20`，`composition=\"\"`，`min_distance=1.5`，`pair_min_distances=\"Fe-O:1.8,O-O:1.2\"`，`strict_mode=True`，打开"
#~ " `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "输出结构保留原 cell/pbc 和元素计数，坐标随机重排，`Config_type` 追加 "
#~ "`RandPack(...)`。检查输出时重点看最短距离分布和后续 DFT 是否仍有明显短键崩溃。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Each output preserves the original cell, "
#~ "periodicity, and element counts while randomizing"
#~ " coordinates. `RandPack(...)` is appended to "
#~ "`Config_type`. Validate the minimum-distance "
#~ "distribution and check whether subsequent DFT "
#~ "calculations still fail because of short "
#~ "contacts."

#~ msgid "组成和数量"
#~ msgstr "Composition and count"

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 1。每个输入结构生成几个独立的随机 packing 版本。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `1`. Number of independent "
#~ "random packings generated for each input "
#~ "structure."

#~ msgid "10-20 个适合无序初始构型试探；50+ 时注意——每个输出结构都要靠随机试错来放置，高密度体系会显著变慢，而且 DFT 预算也成倍放大。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Use 10–20 to probe disordered starting states."
#~ " At 50 or more, placement can become "
#~ "slow in dense systems because each structure"
#~ " relies on repeated random trials, and the"
#~ " downstream DFT cost grows proportionally."

#~ msgid "注意这一卡不接受比例（不接受 `Fe:0.33` 这种写法）。因为随机 packing 需要确切知道每个种类有多少个原子才能放置。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Fractions such as `Fe:0.33` are not accepted."
#~ " Random packing requires an exact integer "
#~ "count for every species before placement "
#~ "begins."

#~ msgid "距离约束"
#~ msgstr "Distance constraints"

#~ msgid "原子是一个一个随机扔进盒子里的。每扔一个，都要检查它跟已经放置的所有原子之间的距离够不够大。下面三个参数控制\"多大算够大\"以及\"试多少次放弃\"。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Atoms are placed one at a time. Every"
#~ " candidate position is checked against all "
#~ "atoms already placed. The following parameters "
#~ "define the required separation and the number"
#~ " of failed trials allowed before placement "
#~ "gives up."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 1.5 Å。全局最小原子对距离——任何两个原子都不允许比这个值更近。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `1.5` Å. Global minimum pair"
#~ " distance; no two atoms may be closer "
#~ "than this value."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "设太小会放行短键坏结构，设太大在高密度 cell 里可能根本放不下所有原子。一个安全的起点是：取体系最短合理键长的 "
#~ "70-90%。比如 Si-Si 键约 2.35 Å，设 1.8 Å "
#~ "通常没问题。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A value that is too small admits bad "
#~ "short-contact structures, while one that is"
#~ " too large may make a dense cell "
#~ "impossible to fill. A useful starting point"
#~ " is 70–90% of the shortest chemically "
#~ "reasonable bond length. For example, with a"
#~ " Si–Si bond near 2.35 Å, 1.8 Å is "
#~ "often a sensible initial constraint."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "元素半径差异大时你会想用这个——O-O 通常比 Fe-O 可以更近一些，同时 Fe-O 可能需要比全局"
#~ " `最小距离`（`min_distance`）更宽松。写在 pair 里的距离覆盖全局值，没写的元素对仍然用 "
#~ "`最小距离`（`min_distance`）。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 500。每个原子最多随机尝试多少次放置位置，超过就认为放不下。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `500`. Maximum random position "
#~ "trials for each atom before that placement "
#~ "is considered impossible."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "增大它只增加搜索时间，不改变物理可行性。如果你发现它一直失败（几乎每次都触达 500 次上限），不是该调大它——是你的 "
#~ "`最小距离`（`min_distance`）设大了，或者 cell 相对原子数太小。先调松距离或扩胞。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid ""
